{% set local_problem %}
<p>Lacey's Spring's hilly terrain creates unique drainage challenges. Hillside properties deal with water flowing downhill toward foundations. Valley properties may have water concentrating in unwanted areas. Traditional sectional gutters can't handle these conditions reliably.</p>

<p>The community's heavy tree coverage makes matters worse. Pine needles and hardwood leaves fill gutters constantly. Sectional gutters with seams every 10 feet have multiple failure points where debris accumulates and leaks develop.</p>

<p>Many Lacey's Spring homes are older properties with decades of weathering. Original gutters have failed, seams have separated, and fascia boards show damage. These homes need comprehensive replacement, not patching.</p>

<p>Seamless gutters eliminate the seam problem entirely. Custom-fabricated on-site, they have no weak points to fail.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Seamless gutters are exactly what they sound like: continuous gutters with no seams except at corners and downspout connections. We fabricate them on-site from a single piece of aluminum coil, custom-cut to fit your home exactly.</p>

<p>We bring our portable gutter machine directly to your Lacey's Spring property and fabricate your gutters right in your driveway.</p>
{% endset %}

